(180462: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Execute%20the%20actual%20observation%20version%20context%20operation%20createObservationVersionValidator.%20Validate%20required%20applicability%20from%20the%20declared%20test%2C%20assertion%20and%20fixture%20triple%20independently%20of%20incoming%20test%20names.%20Actual%20fixture%20paths%20and%20bytes%2C%20exact%20policy%2C%20source%20versions%20and%20selected%20ranges%20must%20match%3B%20missing%2C%20forged%2C%20conflicting%20and%20undeclared%20contexts%20refuse%20evidence.%20Complete%20exact%20source%20encoded%20as%20one%20JSON%20string%3A%20%22export%20function%20createObservationVersionValidator%28%7B%20root%20%3D%20repository%20%7D%20%3D%20%7B%7D%29%20%7B%5Cn%20%20const%20registry%20%3D%20readAssertionVersionPolicy%28root%29%3B%5Cn%20%20if%20%28%21isDeepStrictEqual%28registry.policy%2C%20assertionVersionPolicy%28%29%29%29%20throw%20new%20Error%28%27observation%20version%20bindings%20and%20ranges%20differ%20from%20their%20registered%20authoring%20source%27%29%3B%5Cn%20%20if%20%28%21Array.isArray%28registry.policy.observationBindings%29%29%20throw%20new%20Error%28%27explicit%20observation%20version%20bindings%20are%20required%27%29%3B%5Cn%20%20const%20bindings%20%3D%20new%20Map%28%29%3B%5Cn%20%20for%20%28const%20binding%20of%20registry.policy.observationBindings%29%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20%28%21binding%20%7C%7C%20%21%5B%27testId%27%2C%20%27assertionId%27%2C%20%27fixtureId%27%2C%20%27fixtureFile%27%2C%20%27assertionPolicy%27%5D.every%28field%20%3D%3E%20typeof%20binding%5Bfield%5D%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27string%27%20%26%26%20binding%5Bfield%5D%29%29%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20throw%20new%20Error%28%27observation%20version%20binding%20identities%20must%20be%20explicit%27%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20key%20%3D%20observationIdentity%28binding%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20%28bindings.has%28key%29%29%20throw%20new%20Error%28%27duplicate%20or%20conflicting%20observation%20version%20binding%27%2